            <ArticleTitle>Waking up the healing potential of the bone:subtrochanteric non-union in femoral dysplasia successfully treated after 40 years of pain and disability.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr-2012-007469</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr2012007469</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a successful valgus osteotomy for a subtrochanteric non-union in a dysplastic femur that had not healed in 40 years despite many earlier attempts. The optimisation of biology and biomechanics in the subtrochanteric area shows that even in a longstanding and complex deformity around the hip salvage is possible.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
